WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Your specials. One simple place.
Sheets for staff. A lightweight viewer for guests.

2
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:16.000
Make your restaurant’s copy.
MIT permits commercial use of the code. Hosting has separate terms.

3
00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Start with your Google Sheet.
Staff can edit familiar cells instead of changing website code.

4
00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:41.000
Connect it with Apps Script.
Visitors can read published specials without editing the spreadsheet.

5
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:52.000
Set your connection and address.
Links, QR codes, and previews should belong to your restaurant.

6
00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Publish your first saved menu.
The saved menu appears before the background Sheet update returns.

7
00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:16.000
Add a photo. Skip the extra account.
Small local files load quickly. Cloudinary is optional.

8
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Daily changes happen in the Sheet.
Refresh the deployment snapshot for major changes, not every cell edit.

9
00:01:26.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Test it at an actual table.
Full instructions and troubleshooting are in README.md.
